{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人王丹妮（Louise）本育有一女羅雅念（Affa），下嫁羅孝勇後，今日（25日）王丹妮宣布再次懷孕，為老公羅孝勇佗二人愛的結晶品。</p><p>王丹妮分享同羅孝勇一起手持BB超聲波合照，兩人笑容滿面，一同開心迎接家庭新成員的來臨。</p><p>三年前嘅今日，王丹妮</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:43:57.299327+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T03:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T03:37:13.969756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:37:13.969756+00:00","content_hash":"6b999f2ae9805260c5cfdf81284ab4062cf920bdd2e0ad34004140ed20f06757","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}